From cdb9ba7eaf30b6614436963db197adaff5811e2a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?John=20T=C3=B6rnblom?= <john.tornblom@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 22:14:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/12] zink: support VK_KHR_display surfaces

Kopper gets a display surface type for loaders without a window system.
Zink picks the display's native mode and a plane that can show it. A
present mode a surface doesn't offer falls back to FIFO.

On the PS4, zink links RADV's libvulkan instead of loading a Vulkan
loader.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
